OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day with rain clearing
OL,6,Fsoutheastwards during the morning.
OL,7,FShowers developing during the
OL,8,Fafternoon some of which maybe heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes, mainly over high ground and
OL,10,Falong the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClearing skies overnight with
OL,13,Flight winds, any showers being
OL,14,Fconfined to the coast where it remains
OL,15,Fbreezy. feeling cooler than of late.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA cool and dry start with
OL,18,Fplenty of morning sunshine. Becoming
OL,19,Fcloudy during the afternoon with the
OL,20,Fchance of some isolated showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
